<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 511 0 R
/E (The SwiftRide fare calculation system was adapted to include shared rides, surge pricing, additional charges, GST, loyalty discounts and time-window promotions. Retain-and-prioritise, decision-table modification and model-based testing were compared. The updated decision complexity is estimated at 36 under the stated 35-predicate assumption, and the 10-minute regression limit permits at most 300 sequential two-second tests before accounting for test overhead. )
/Pg 105 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
