/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 514 0 R
/E (The overall testing activities demonstrate that software testing is a continuous process that supports the development and maintenance of reliable applications. Applying different testing techniques helps examine the system from multiple perspectives and improves the chances of detecting defects. )
/Pg 108 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
4343 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 514 0 R
/E (A proper testing process helps identify such issues before the application is released. It also reduces the possibility of failures during actual usage. By testing valid and invalid inputs, developers can improve input validation and make the application more reliable. )
/Pg 108 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
4344 0 obj
<<
