/E (Testing also supports future software maintenance. When developers introduce new features or modify existing business rules, regression testing helps verify that the previous functionality has not been affected. Automated testing can further reduce repeated manual effort and provide faster feedback during development. )
/Pg 108 0 R
/K [4]
>>
