/Title (Changing requirements create another challenge. When new features such as shared rides, surge pricing, loyalty discounts, and additional charges are introduced, existing test cases may no longer be sufficient. The testing team must identify affected areas, update test data, and perform regression testing to ensure that existing functionality continues to work correctly. IMPORTANCE OF TESTING IN REAL-WORLD APPLICATIONS)
