/Title (Several challenges were considered during the testing of the SwiftRide system. One challenge was identifying all the possible combinations of input conditions. The fare engine contains multiple parameters, including distance, waiting time, booking time, promotional codes, payment modes, and wallet balance. Testing every possible combination would require a large number of test cases. Pairwise testing and decision table techniques help manage this complexity.)
